1
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,300
Is this the ancient divine vein?

2
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:45,560
It actually allowed you to recover your divine power so quickly.

3
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,200
Zhaohan,

4
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,660
what you owed me three hundred years ago,

5
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:50,960
today,

6
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,290
it's time to pay it back.

7
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:01,490
Am I seeing this right?

8
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,900
That's the God of War, Baili.

9
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:04,099
Wasn't her divine bone extracted long ago

10
00:01:04,099 --> 00:01:05,960
and she was banished to the Demon Realm?

11
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,090
How could it be fake?

12
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,930
Didn't His Majesty say she lost all her magic power

13
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:11,230
and was no different from a cripple?

14
00:01:11,230 --> 00:01:12,400
Look at the golden light around her.

15
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,730
It's even more terrifying than at her peak.

16
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:16,600
Isn't going up there just seeking death?

17
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,400
What are you panicking for? Even if she's alive,

18
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,200
she's no longer the God of War from back then.

19
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,200
His Majesty has ordered:

20
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,300
capture the rebel,

21
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,800
and be promoted three ranks.

22
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,030
You want to stop me?

23
00:01:25,030 --> 00:01:26,700
Just with you guys?

24
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,760
Across the sky.

25
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,900
Zijing Misheng.

26
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,000
Baili,

27
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,560
go to hell.

28
00:02:34,930 --> 00:02:36,190
Is this all you've got?

29
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,130
Three hundred years and you haven't improved at all.

30
00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:45,860
You're actually stronger than you were three hundred years ago.

31
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,760
Your Majesty, we can't fight her head-on anymore.

32
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:50,630
The Soul Refining Array.

33
00:02:50,630 --> 00:02:52,690
Quickly use the Soul Refining Array.

34
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,430
Is this the Soul Refining Array?

35
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,000
Zhaohan,

36
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,260
you actually practice forbidden arts.

37
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:27,500
So what if it's a forbidden art?

38
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:28,730
If you hadn't forced me,

39
00:03:28,730 --> 00:03:29,960
why would I have come to this?

40
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,329
Baili, you were supposed to be my Heavenly Empress,

41
00:03:32,329 --> 00:03:34,130
the sharpest sword in my hand.

42
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:36,100
But you just had to have a change of heart,

43
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:37,300
you just had to side with the Demon Tribe,

44
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:38,630
and side with Cangyuan.

45
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:43,400
Ridiculous. I was born to be myself,

46
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:44,800
not anyone's sword,

47
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,930
and certainly not your accessory.

48
00:03:54,430 --> 00:03:55,360
What's going on?

49
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:57,730
This array is absorbing my spiritual power.

50
00:03:57,730 --> 00:04:01,600
It's useless. This Soul Refining Array was refined from the souls and divine consciousness

51
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,330
of thirty-six High Immortals.

52
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,330
It specifically absorbs divine power and divine souls.

53
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:06,600
The harder you fight,

54
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,020
the faster it absorbs,

55
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,930
until it drains you dry,

56
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:13,090
and refines your divine consciousness completely.

57
00:04:15,330 --> 00:04:17,990
You were a sword I cultivated single-handedly.

58
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:20,860
A sword should look like a sword.

59
00:04:21,329 --> 00:04:23,060
It shouldn't have its own will,

60
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:26,260
and it certainly shouldn't disobey the one who wields it.

61
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:28,000
Once your divine consciousness is refined,

62
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,630
you will be obedient,

63
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:31,400
stay by my side forever,

64
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,620
be my most perfect Heavenly Empress,

65
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:35,830
and my sharpest weapon.

66
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,430
It seems Cangyuan has left safely.

67
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:45,000
It's still uncertain who will win.

68
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,560
How could this happen?

69
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:12,130
Everything in the world has a cause and a solution.

70
00:05:12,130 --> 00:05:13,130
I don't believe

71
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,630
there's really no way to break this array.

72
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:17,230
But where is the solution?

73
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:17,900
Where?

74
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,960
Wife, don't push so hard.

75
00:05:23,230 --> 00:05:24,600
This door is very evil.

76
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:26,020
The harder you push it,

77
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:27,300
the tighter it closes.

78
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,830
You have to do the opposite.

79
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,400
Fallacies and heresies.

80
00:05:35,330 --> 00:05:36,400
I see.

81
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:38,500
I am the source of the power.

82
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,830
The more I resist,

83
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,100
the stronger it gets,

84
00:05:41,130 --> 00:05:41,930
and the firmer the formation becomes.
